catalogue abstyles-orig
shortdesc Adaptable BibTeX styles
longdesc A family of modifications of the standard BibTeX styles whose
longdesc behaviour may be changed by changing the user document, without
longdesc change to the styles themselves. The package is largely used
longdesc nowadays in its adaptation for working with Babel.
